config VAPOROS_VTERMTEST
	tristate "vtermtest -- libvterm Milestone 1: build+parse smoke test"
	default n
	---help---
		Vendored libvterm (MIT, Paul Evans) compiled through the real
		NuttX app pipeline, plus a small test that feeds it a string
		containing real ANSI escape sequences and prints back what it
		parsed. Milestone 1 of docs/vaporterm.md -- proves the library
		itself is portable here before any NX rendering work is built
		on top of it.

